  "term": "knowledge representation",
  "definition": "Knowledge representation is the way information or concepts are mentally organized so their relationships can be mapped or inferred. In this source, it refers to how emotional concepts are arranged in the mind, such as their coherence and grouping along dimensions like arousal.",
